                     <li><b>Head Line:</b>Indicates intellectual abilities, learning styles, and decision-making tendencies. It shows how you approach thoughts and knowledge.</li>
                     <li><b>Life Line:</b>Shows the overall life journey, vitality, health, and significant life events. It reflects your strength and general life path.</li>
                     <li><b>Fate Line:</b>Represents destiny, career path, and life challenges. It reveals the influence of external factors and how they affect your life’s direction.</li>
                 </ul>
