                     <li><b>Health Line:</b>Reflects health issues, stamina, and vitality, giving insight into your physical health.</li>
                     <li><b>Children Line:</b>Reflects information regarding your children, their well-being, and relationship dynamics with them.</li>
                     <li><b>Travel Line:</b>Indicates long travels or journeys, either physical or spiritual, that will shape your future.</li>
